{
  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"根据投放内容所在的不同行业获取不同行业下对应的资质提交规则。调用API之前，需首先查询本接口获取所选行业投放产品资质的配置规则（拿到config_id）。每个行业的配置规则由必填资质模块 `necessaries`、选填资质模块 `unnecessaries` 构成，至少传其中一个模块。可根据config_id判断规则是否发生变化，建议每7 - 14天定期通过本接口查询config_id是否发生变化，如变化请存储最新的配置规则。配合接口有【获取Access token】【上传/更新营销产品资质】。\",\"id\":\"advertiser.delivery_pkg_config.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/advertiser/delivery_pkg_config/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"1776710970860551\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求本接口需要通过此接口获取授权access_token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"marketing_product_qualification.upload_or_update\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/34/docs/1776711210685572\",\"reason\":\"根据本接口获取的投放类型id，前往此接口操作资质上传/更新\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"上传/更新营销产品资质\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"1776710970860551\",\"title\":\"获取营销产品资质规则配置\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-G1bD7LDa\">根据商业化行业获取不同行业下对应的资质提交规则。需注意：每个行业下的资质提交规则可能会因平台及外部监管的要求而发生变化，当规则发生变更时，规则的版本号+1</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-ALGFAJ99\" id=\"h346b9f0-ALGFAJ99\">逻辑说明</h1><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vYpPm%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-Jxj2GDuw%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3E%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E9%80%BB%E8%BE%91%E6%80%BB%E4%BD%93%E4%BB%8B%E7%BB%8D%EF%BC%9A%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E6%89%80%E5%9C%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%9A%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E4%B8%80%E7%BB%84%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E7%9A%84%E3%80%81%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E8%81%94%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%84%E8%B4%A8%E6%89%8D%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%BD%A2%E6%88%90%E8%AF%81%E6%98%8E%E6%95%88%E5%8A%9B%E3%80%82%3C%2Fstrong%3E%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8API%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%8D%EF%BC%8C%E6%82%A8%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E9%A6%96%E5%85%88%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E6%9C%AC%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E6%89%80%E9%80%89%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%9A%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E8%B5%84%E8%B4%A8%E7%9A%84%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%EF%BC%88%E6%8B%BF%E5%88%B0config_id)%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cul%20data-id%3D%5C%22u738a58b-F5hR7Tbo%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-JhELNRW5%5C%22%3E%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%AA%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%9A%E7%9A%84%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E7%94%B12%E4%B8%AA%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%E7%BB%84%E6%88%90%EF%BC%9A%E5%BF%85%E5%A1%AB%E8%B5%84%E8%B4%A8%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%E2%80%8B%3Ccode%3E%E2%80%8Bnecessaries%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fcode%3E%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E3%80%81%E9%80%89%E5%A1%AB%E8%B5%84%E8%B4%A8%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%E2%80%8B%3Ccode%3E%E2%80%8Bunnecessaries%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fcode%3E%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8B%E6%9E%84%E6%88%90%EF%BC%8C%E8%87%B3%E5%B0%91%E4%BC%A0%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-E3HSd70c%5C%22%3E%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%9A%3Cspan%20style%3D%5C%22color%3A%20%23f5222d%3B%5C%22%3E%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%97%B6%E5%88%BB%3C%2Fspan%3E%E5%8F%AA%E4%BC%9A%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E4%B8%80%E7%BB%84config_id%EF%BC%8C%E9%87%8C%E9%9D%A2%E7%9A%84%E5%90%84%E9%A1%B9id%E5%9D%87%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%E3%80%82%E4%BD%86%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%A5%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%9A%E7%9A%84%E8%B5%84%E8%B4%A8%E6%94%B6%E5%8F%96%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%99%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84config_id%E4%BC%9A%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AEconfig_id%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-RhOSLDg1%5C%22%3E%E7%94%B1%E4%BA%8Econfig_id%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%B9%B6%E4%B8%8D%E5%9B%BA%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%8C%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%E6%82%A8%E6%AF%8F7-14%E5%A4%A9%E5%AE%9A%E6%9C%9F%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E6%9C%AC%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2config_id%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%82%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%E8%AF%B7%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E6%9C%80%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E8%A7%84%E5%88%99%E3%80%82%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Jxj2GDuw\"><strong>业务逻辑总体介绍：根据投放内容所在的不同行业需要一组完整的、相关联的资质才可以形成证明效力。</strong>调用API之前，您需要首先查询本接口获取所选行业投放产品资质的配置规则（拿到config_id)</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-F5hR7Tbo\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-JhELNRW5\">每个行业的配置规则由2个模块组成：必填资质模块<code>necessaries</code>、选填资质模块<code>unnecessaries</code>构成，至少传其中一个模块</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-E3HSd70c\">每一个行业<span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">同一时刻</span>只会对应一组config_id，里面的各项id均不会变化。但如果平台针对该行业的资质收取规则发生变化，则其中的config_id会发生变化，可以根据config_id判断规则是否发生变化</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-RhOSLDg1\">由于config_id可能发生变化，且变化时间并不固定，建议您每7-14天定期通过本接口查询config_id是否发生变化，如变化请存储最新的配置规则。</li></ul></div></div></div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-9GGZjYX5\" id=\"h346b9f0-9GGZjYX5\"><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/f380fd6a6d23423cb4eeae27080567bf~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2018401427&amp;x-signature=zUm2gxAtlTrllqIdoY29Osb8DiU%3D\" style=\"width: 423px; visibility: visible; height: 231px;\"/><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/a49535ae35ce48ecb119176d4636b307~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2018401562&amp;x-signature=vJyHsLDSMLffQGkbzTSOFUjh08w%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/></h1><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-JfkQ1IHp\" id=\"h346b9f0-JfkQ1IHp\"><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/7c86e76e5b1c47c2a2f770abf23eaa0d~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2018402445&amp;x-signature=mNESTxd0nGetdUNK764vxu%2BRSm4%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/a47c67ac83b3412a97cc9c258a8464e5~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2018401868&amp;x-signature=zcceWcy%2BHxmmPnqh2L5nuZlb8QU%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/></h1>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201775542819201032%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-ZgVZCH9F\" id=\"h346b9f0-ZgVZCH9F\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-gI29VNTV\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/advertiser/delivery_pkg_config/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/advertiser/delivery_pkg_config/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1776710970860551\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: