scription\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-UZiLnjrk\">返回码,详见 <a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\">【附录-返回码】</a></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">message</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-X9EOVkqU\">返回信息,详见 <a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\">【附录-返回码】</a></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">data</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>json</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hKrMK9Ki\">json返回值</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 20px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">industry_config</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-iTm21ie2\">资质规则</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">config_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KTGAsA6D\">资质规则id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">industry_status</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-cCLeWz4D\">行业状态：1 生效 、2 禁投（不允许提交该行业的资质） 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-RgSLVFJK\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-M1hf3kaD\"><code>NONVALID</code> 禁投</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7TKNV4LE\"><code>VALID</code> 生效</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">industry_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-e6HpmjAs\">第一级到第三级行业id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">industry_names</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6Ao9oLjL\">第一级到第三级行业名称</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 36px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">necessaries</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XObt8MLu\">必填资质模块配置</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">promotion_type_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bknm3mXG\">投放类型id</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-1StRuFZX\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-os5s8W7f\">您可以根据不同的投放类型设定多组不一样的必填资质，您需要根据自己的投放情况选择一个投放类型，前往【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/34/docs/1776711210685572\" target=\"_blank\">上传/更新营销产品资质</a>】接口操作资质上传/更新</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BKAP6xOJ\">若不区分投放类型，则该行业下仅有一组必填的资质</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">promotion_type_name</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BlGHBnxD\">投放类型名称</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 52px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">rules</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HkoBsI5X\">具体的资质规则，每个资质规则可以分为选择型或组合型</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"4\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">rule_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OlE9PMYV\">原子规则id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"4\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-xCXH2G5P\">规则的资质组成类型：1 组合资质 2 多选一资质 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-RhP76SlO\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-dMJJ80UB\"><code>CHOICE</code> 选择（资质规则内资质类型任选&gt;1个类型填写提交），规则中会返回多个资质类型，您需要至少选择一种上传</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-RfjYKGgF\"><code>COMPOSE</code> 组合（资质规则内资质类型必须全部填写提交），规则中会至少返回1个资质类型，全部类型您都需要上传</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"4\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">description</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kK1luSL6\">原子规则描述，用于引导用户提交</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"4\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 68px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">qual_types</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-grTJrltb\">资质类型</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"5\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 96px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">qual_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-SbxkB3oc\">资质类型id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"5\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 96px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">qual_type_name</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XgYhHx8e\">资质类型名称</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 36px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">unnecessaries</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-GxcYe8XV\">选填资质模块配置，您可根据自己的投放情况自主判断是否需要提交</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-niWLV5dT\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-aGE1uXmZ\">每个行业选填资质模块可以包含多个<code>combine_id</code>，每种id都对应一套配置规则</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">combine_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-LH3WapHW\">规则组合id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">description</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-abmnJ9T5\">规则组合的描述内容</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 52px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">rules</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qJxkm7WO\">具体的资质规则</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"4\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">rule_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-xbsC5eqU\">原子规则id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"4\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ahqWzhO5\">规则的资质填写类型， 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-CPOgeMV9\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7ON5kqqK\"><code>CHOICE</code> 选择（至少需要选择1种资质类型提交）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cE0HAaRk\"><code>COMPOSE</code> 组合（资质规则内资质类型必须全部提交）</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"4\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">description</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-alvYcU7N\">对于规则的描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"4\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 80px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 68px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\